Test suite for Foreign Function Interface.

Build the foreign files first (make macosx, or make linux, ...).  Then,
in this directory:

    larceny -- abi-test.sch              ; prints "abi-test: ok"

and, in a Larceny started in this directory, as described at the head
of each file:

    (load "ffi-test.sch") (run-basic-ffi-tests)
    (require 'std-ffi) (load "std-ffi-test.sch") (run-std-ffi-tests)

These print nothing more if all tests pass.
